cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these estimates, please cite the manuscript below. Add your ORCID iD to the author block before the first release."
title: "food-insecurity-nigeria: LGA-level Bayesian small-area estimates of severe household food insecurity in Nigeria"
abstract: >-
  Code and derived area-level results for a Bayesian small-area analysis of severe household food
  insecurity across Nigeria's 774 Local Government Areas, from the 2024 Nigeria Demographic and Health
  Survey, fitted in R-INLA. The repository carries four propositions on the sharp bounds for the
  variance of a count of areas above a threshold, an identification analysis for areas holding no
  sampled cluster, and a spatial cross-validation protocol with pass rules fixed in advance.
